      "title": "## Overview",
      "content": "This plan outlines the creation of KaziLinks, a website designed to connect freelancers with clients for various services. It will feature a directory of services and freelancers, a booking system with date, time, and availability selection, location options, online payments, and ETA tracking."
    },
    {
      "id": "key-features",
      "title": "## Key features",
      "content": "- **View Service Categories**: Displays a list of all available service categories.\n- **Filter Service Categories**: Allows users to filter services by category.\n- **View Service Listing**: Shows all services offered within a selected category.\n- **View Service Details**: Provides detailed information about a specific service.\n- **View Freelancer Listing**: Displays a list of available freelancers.\n- **Filter Freelancers**: Allows users to filter freelancers based on skills or availability.\n- **View Freelancer Details**: Shows detailed information about a specific freelancer, including their availability.\n- **Submit Booking Request**: Allows clients to select a service, date, time, and an available freelancer, and specify service location.\n- **Calculate Transportation Costs**: Calculates and displays transportation costs based on service location selection.\n- **Process Online Payment**: Enables clients to make online payments to validate bookings.\n- **View ETA Tracking**: Provides live tracking for estimated arrival times.",
